  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote equality and counteract discrimination by promoting and protecting the human rights of Indigenous Peoples in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project shall consolidate the results obtained in the previous phases of the Maya Programme. The main objective is to promote the righs to equality and non-discrimination of indigenous people and Afrodescendants in Guatemala, with a special focus on women, youth and persons with disabilities,</narrative>
  </description>
